<title>USA: Harris Cty MUD 360, Texas, won by Southwest Sec.</title>
<headline>Harris Cty MUD 360, Texas, won by Southwest Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities, Inc., said it won $3.350 million of Harris Cty MUD 360, Texas, general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.70 percent.</p>
</text>
